1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"first":1,"second":65,"attributeRules":117,"libraries":120},{"name":2,"intro":3,"touse":4,"nottouse":5,"logo":6,"attributes":7,"key":64},"NuxtUI","Nuxt UI is a component library for Nuxt.js applications, providing a set of pre-built, customizable components designed to integrate seamlessly with the Nuxt framework. It offers a range of UI elements and tools for building modern web interfaces.","Use Nuxt UI when you're building Nuxt.js applications and want to leverage a component library specifically designed for the framework. It's suitable for projects that benefit from a consistent design system and tight integration with Nuxt.js features.","Avoid Nuxt UI if you're not using Nuxt.js, or if you need a component library that works with other frameworks. Also, consider the dependency size and the potential impact on your application's performance.","\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 1020 200\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\u003Cpath d=\"M377 200C379.16 200 381 198.209 381 196V103C381 103 386 112 395 127L434 194C435.785 197.74 439.744 200 443 200H470V50H443C441.202 50 439 51.4941 439 54V148L421 116L385 55C383.248 51.8912 379.479 50 376 50H350V200H377Z\" fill=\"currentColor\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M726 92H739C742.314 92 745 89.3137 745 86V60H773V92H800V116H773V159C773 169.5 778.057 174 787 174H800V200H783C759.948 200 745 185.071 745 160V116H726V92Z\" fill=\"currentColor\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M591 92V154C591 168.004 585.742 179.809 578 188C570.258 196.191 559.566 200 545 200C530.434 200 518.742 196.191 511 188C503.389 179.809 498 168.004 498 154V92H514C517.412 92 520.769 92.622 523 95C525.231 97.2459 526 98.5652 526 102V154C526 162.059 526.457 167.037 530 171C533.543 174.831 537.914 176 545 176C552.217 176 555.457 174.831 559 171C562.543 167.037 563 162.059 563 154V102C563 98.5652 563.769 96.378 566 94C567.96 91.9107 570.028 91.9599 573 92C573.411 92.0055 574.586 92 575 92H591Z\" fill=\"currentColor\">\u003C/path>\u003